  <!-- EN: medic warcasket helmet -->
  <MDWC_WarcasketHelmet_Medic.label>醫療型戰棺頭盔</MDWC_WarcasketHelmet_Medic.label>
  <!-- EN: Specialized spacer-tech warcasket helmet with standard protection, equipped with a medical assistance module and a diagnostic visor that lets the mechanite dressing treat disease and infection as well as wounds. -->
  <MDWC_WarcasketHelmet_Medic.shortDescription>特化型太空科技戰棺頭盔，在不增加機體重量的同時極大幅提升了防護性。配備醫療輔助模組和診斷面罩，讓機械分子包紮除了傷口之外，也能治療疾病和感染。</MDWC_WarcasketHelmet_Medic.shortDescription>
